sec.p:
We suggest that short-term priorities for improvement under the current MCDA approach comprise the following:
Separating the two data inputs that contribute to this map layer so that it is explicit what is being represented in the mapping;
Aligning the methodology and mapping with the metrics and targets for delivering the National Reserve System, as outlined in the NRS Strategy [5];
Including a measure of the proportion of each bioregion’s and subregion’s land and freshwater area that is included in protected areas to help with prioritization (as per the NRS Strategy).
